OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFemale runners forced to change
OL,4,Ahabits, stats show
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrighton is an amazing city to run in
OL,7,Fbut women are still forced to change
OL,8,Ftheir habits when it gets dark, a run
OL,9,Fclub vice-chair says.
OL,11,FNew figures from Sport England show 47%
OL,12,Fof women in Brighton, and 51% in the
OL,13,Fwider South East, feel unsafe while
OL,14,Fexercising outdoors alone after dark.
OL,16,FThe statistics come as part of a
OL,17,Fcampaign calling for more support to
OL,18,Fhelp women feel safe while exercising
OL,19,Fin the evening and end a "hidden
OL,20,Fcurfew" when the light fades.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
